sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant App as Phone app
  participant St as Storage
  participant Fn as publish_moment()
  App->>St: Upload photos to owner_id/media_id
  App->>Fn: rpc(draft, chosen relationships)
  activate Fn
  Note over Fn: One transaction
  Fn->>Fn: Check the author, files are ready,<br/>each relationship is active
  Fn->>Fn: Mark published, add one share per relationship
  Fn->>Fn: Open one conversation per share
  Fn-->>App: Moment and its shares
  deactivate Fn
  App->>App: Refresh the Home feed cache
